ce but twice Angelica was  filled with excitement and gratitude  that she left a few tears on that stage  but she came back for her final  performance on champions and amazed  everyone again with her final song  impossible it came down to the finale of  egt champions and although Angelica did  not win the competition she is a  promising future as a singer and as a  big sister Darci Lin this 12 year old  ventriloquist from Oklahoma City made a  huge impression on Simon  [Music]  and the rest of the judges from the very  start she came out with her rabbit  puppet who goes by the name petunia and  saying summertime it was incredible the  judges were flabbergasted that she could  sing that well with her mouth closed  Darcy said that she started doing  ventriloquism because she was shy and it  helped her find her voice and come out  of her shell she was absolutely adorable  on stage Nobby gave her the gold buzzer  and everyone cried with her then she  introduced to more puppets a mouse named  Oscar who has a crush on Mel B later she  came out with an elderly puppet named  Edna door knocker  who's in love with Simon but when she  came back for the fourth time with both  Oscar the mouse and petunia the bunny it  was clear she was a champion Oscar yeah  but then she took it a step further for  the Champions finale when she performed  with Edna and roll the dog from the  Muppets  Simon was inspired to give Edna a kiss  on the cheek and America was inspired to  give Darcy her own show  proving that ventriloquism is still  alive and well chin limb chin limb has  been called the greatest sleight-of-hand  magician of all time from his first card  trick with Tyra Banks it was clear that  this guy has major talent he turned the  cards into a clear smoking pile before  they completely vanished seriously how  did he do that in his second appearance  on a GT the dude literally made cards  disappear before Olivia Munn and the  rest of the world dies petty called his  magic mind-blowing when he won America's  Got Talent he said it was a dream come  true but then he was invited back to be  on egt champions and that's when he  kicked the magic up a notch he had cards  smoking in his mouth and when how he  found the card inside his water cup he  was completely blown away Chin's final  performance was the most jaw-dropping of  them all he did a card trick for Melissa  Fumero he switched her card the queen of  diamonds even though it was in her mouth  and he took a picture of her with a  blank card at the beginning of the trick  on her phone and later the picture  showed the queen of diamonds totally  mind-blowing moment  it's no wonder Shen Lim was crowned  America's Got Talent global champion  what was your favorite age  audition tell us in the comments below  don't forget to subscribe to the things  to be the first to see our latest videos  thanks for watching and see you next  time  [Music]

